%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant PR as PrismaService
    participant JWT as JwtService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE LOGIN

    C->>AC: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    AC->>AS: login(dto)
    AS->>PR: user.findUnique({where: {email}})
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "User" WHERE email=?
    DB-->>PR: User | null
    PR-->>AS: User
    alt Usuario no existe
        AS-->>C: 401 Credenciales invalidas
    end
    AS->>AS: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    alt Contrasena incorrecta
        AS-->>C: 401 Credenciales invalidas
    end
    AS->>JWT: sign(accessPayload, {expiresIn: 15m})
    JWT-->>AS: accessToken
    AS->>JWT: sign(refreshPayload, {expiresIn: 7d})
    JWT-->>AS: refreshToken
    AS-->>AC: user + Set-Cookie accessToken + refreshToken
    AC-->>C: 200 {user}

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE REFRESH

    C->>AC: POST /auth/refresh
    Note over AC: Cookie refreshToken=<token>
    AC->>AS: refresh(refreshToken from cookie)
    AS->>JWT: verify(refreshToken, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET)
    alt Token invalido o expirado
        AS-->>C: 401 Refresh token invalido
    end
    AS->>JWT: sign(new accessPayload, {expiresIn: 15m})
    JWT-->>AS: newAccessToken
    AS-->>AC: user + Set-Cookie new accessToken
    AC-->>C: 200 {user}

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE LOGOUT

    C->>AC: POST /auth/logout
    Note over AC: Cookie accessToken=<token>
    AC->>AS: logout()
    AS-->>AC: Clear cookies
    AC-->>C: 200 {message: Logged out successfully}